WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.098
Hi, I'm Jerry from The Happy Start.

00:00:03.098 --> 00:00:11.066
One of the hardest things about launching a new product on Amazon is getting those first few reviews.

00:00:11.066 --> 00:00:18.590
You know your product is great, but customers are hesitant to buy something that doesn't have any

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:19.475
reviews yet.

00:00:19.475 --> 00:00:27.000
Today, I'm going to tell you exactly how we solved that problem using the Amazon Vine program.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:28.900
So what is it?

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:34.000
Vine is Amazon's internal service that helps sellers get high quality reviews fast and easily.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.760
Amazon invites their most trusted reviewers to test your products for free in exchange

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.460
for honest and unbiased feedback.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:42.500
These aren't just one word reviews.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.920
They typically include videos and photos and real detail that helps future customers

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.960
make a decision about your product.

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:52.360
Here's how it applied to us at the happy start.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.778
We sell baby products, which is an incredibly crowded space.

00:00:55.778 --> 00:01:00.665
So you might imagine that parents and caregivers are understandably very careful when shopping.

00:01:00.665 --> 00:01:06.600
They need to see some serious social proof before they trust a new brand with their child.

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:09.896
That's why we use Vine from day one.

00:01:09.896 --> 00:01:14.360
Since launching, we've enrolled in Vine five times and secured 108 reviews.

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:20.223
Which, in this market, that's that competitive, those 100+ trusted reviews gave us the credibility

00:01:20.223 --> 00:01:22.009
we needed to stand out.

00:01:22.009 --> 00:01:27.366
Plus, it helped us quickly verify that we had a product that was in demand.

00:01:27.366 --> 00:01:32.723
Now, you should know that there is a fee, an enrollment fee related to Vine.

00:01:32.723 --> 00:01:35.223
But my advice, it's totally worth it.

00:01:35.223 --> 00:01:40.937
Whether you're a brand new seller or you've been selling for years, those first few reviews

00:01:40.937 --> 00:01:43.080
are critical for a successful launch.

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:48.760
Vine is hands down one of the best programs Amazon offers.
